","faceText":"","meaning":"主体进入语言，被能指（比如“我”“吾”“i”“me”）代表后产生的分裂与缺失。","color":"#a465c8","kwOn":true,"namePos":"top","kwPos":"bottom","nameVy":14,"nameH":"c","nameFs":58,"kwVy":84,"kwH":"c","kwFs":50,"nameBg":"#ffffff","nameBgA":62,"kwBg":"#ffffff","kwBgA":62,"symbolImg":"assets/sym/sowilo.png","imagePath":"images/38.jpg","imageHiPath":null},{"id":"card-mu2ccehs-fxzuib","name":"压抑·遗忘","keyword":"防御机制","symbol":"✦","faceText":"","meaning":"","color":"#3e9ee8","kwOn":true,"namePos":"top","kwPos":"bottom","nameVy":14,"nameH":"c","nameFs":58,"kwVy":84,"kwH":"c","kwFs":50,"nameBg":"#ffffff","nameBgA":62,"kwBg":"#ffffff","kwBgA":62,"symbolImg":"assets/sym/sowilo.png","imagePath":"images/39.jpg","imageHiPath":null},{"id":"card-mu2cefab-kqsic8","name":"否认","keyword":"防御机制","symbol":"✦","faceText":"","meaning":"","color":"#5b7cfa","kwOn":true,"namePos":"top","kwPos":"bottom","nameVy":14,"nameH":"c","nameFs":58,"kwVy":84,"kwH":"c","kwFs":50,"nameBg":"#ffffff","nameBgA":62,"kwBg":"#ffffff","kwBgA":62,"symbolImg":"assets/sym/sowilo.png","imagePath":"images/40.jpg","imageHiPath":null},{"id":"card-mu2cerp9-814jbz","name":"合理化","keyword":"防御机制","symbol":"✦","faceText":"","meaning":"","color":"#8a5cf6","kwOn":true,"namePos":"top","kwPos":"bottom","nameVy":14,"nameH":"c","nameFs":58,"kwVy":84,"kwH":"c","kwFs":50,"nameBg":"#ffffff","nameBgA":62,"kwBg":"#ffffff","kwBgA":62,"symbolImg":"assets/sym/sowilo.png","imagePath":"images/41.jpg","imageHiPath":null},{"id":"card-mu2cf9js-75kpp7","name":"置换","keyword":"防御机制","symbol":"✦","faceText":"","meaning":"把情绪从真正来源转移到更安全的对象上。比如被老板骂了，回家冲伴侣或孩子发火。","color":"#e2558c","kwOn":true,"namePos":"top","kwPos":"bottom","nameVy":14,"nameH":"c","nameFs":58,"kwVy":84,"kwH":"c","kwFs":50,"nameBg":"#ffffff","nameBgA":62,"kwBg":"#ffffff","kwBgA":62,"symbolImg":"assets/sym/sowilo.png","imagePath":"images/42.jpg","imageHiPath":null},{"id":"card-mu2cfjl0-f8rtmq","name":"反向形成","keyword":"防御机制","symbol":"✦","faceText":"","meaning":"把爱说成恨，把敌意说成忠诚。大多防御机制都可以视作是不同层面不同路径的反向形成。","color":"#f59f3e","kwOn":true,"namePos":"top","kwPos":"bottom","nameVy":14,"nameH":"c","nameFs":58,"kwVy":84,"kwH":"c","kwFs":50,"nameBg":"#ffffff","nameBgA":62,"kwBg":"#ffffff","kwBgA":62,"symbolImg":"assets/sym/sowilo.png","imagePath":"images/43.jpg","imageHiPath":null},{"id":"card-mu2chd2p-7eqtpk","name":"投射","keyword":"防御机制","symbol":"✦","faceText":"","meaning":"把自己不能接受的情绪或冲动归到别人身上。比如自己很生气，却说“是你一直在生我气”；自己好胜，却觉得别人都在攀比。\nps：多数防御机制都可以看作是不同层面或方法的反向形成。","color":"#2fb89a","kwOn":true,"namePos":"top","kwPos":"bottom","nameVy":14,"nameH":"c","nameFs":58,"kwVy":84,"kwH":"c","kwFs":50,"nameBg":"#ffffff","nameBgA":62,"kwBg":"#ffffff","kwBgA":62,"symbolImg":"assets/sym/sowilo.png","imagePath":"images/44.jpg","imageHiPath":null},{"id":"card-mu2ciop8-wtxi5b","name":"分裂","keyword":"防御机制","symbol":"✦","faceText":"","meaning":"把人或事看成全好或全坏，难以整合。比如今天觉得某人完美，明天觉得对方一无是处。","color":"#e5484d","kwOn":true,"namePos":"top","kwPos":"bottom","nameVy":14,"nameH":"c","nameFs":58,"kwVy":84,"kwH":"c","kwFs":50,"nameBg":"#ffffff","nameBgA":62,"kwBg":"#ffffff","kwBgA":62,"symbolImg":"assets/sym/sowilo.png","imagePath":"images/45.jpg","imageHiPath":null},{"id":"card-mu2cj688-d7pune","name":"认同","keyword":"防御机制","symbol":"✦","faceText":"","meaning":"通过模仿重要他人来缓解无力感。比如孩子模仿严厉的父母；受欺负的人有时会认同攻击者，转而欺负更弱的人。","color":"#3e9ee8","kwOn":true,"namePos":"top","kwPos":"bottom","nameVy":14,"nameH":"c","nameFs":58,"kwVy":84,"kwH":"c","kwFs":50,"nameBg":"#ffffff","nameBgA":62,"kwBg":"#ffffff","kwBgA":0,"symbolImg":"assets/sym/sowilo.png","imagePath":"images/46.jpg","imageHiPath":null},{"id":"card-mu2cjklp-ed31bk","name":"升华","keyword":"高级防御","symbol":"✦","faceText":"","meaning":"把原始冲动转化为社会认可的形式。比如攻击性去运动、竞技；痛苦去写作、画画、做音乐。这是较成熟的防御。","color":"#a465c8","kwOn":true,"namePos":"top","kwPos":"bottom","nameVy":14,"nameH":"c","nameFs":58,"kwVy":84,"kwH":"c","kwFs":50,"nameBg":"#ffffff","nameBgA":62,"kwBg":"#ffffff","kwBgA":62,"symbolImg":"assets/sym/sowilo.png","imagePath":"images/47.jpg","imageHiPath":null},{"id":"card-mu2cjykh-u2gx8v","name":"幽默","keyword":"防御机制","symbol":"✦","faceText":"","meaning":"用开玩笑表达痛苦和冲突，但不伤害自己和他人。比如自嘲式幽默，也是较成熟的防御。","color":"#5b7cfa","kwOn":true,"namePos":"top","kwPos":"bottom","nameVy":14,"nameH":"c","nameFs":58,"kwVy":84,"kwH":"c","kwFs":50,"nameBg":"#ffffff","nameBgA":62,"kwBg":"#ffffff","kwBgA":62,"symbolImg":"assets/sym/sowilo.png","imagePath":"images/48.jpg","imageHiPath":null},{"id":"card-mu2dacif-fizhd8","name":"投射型认同","keyword":"","symbol":"✦","faceText":"","meaning":"1 a将自己分裂的部分投射到b身上。\n2 诱导b以特定的方式做出回应。\n3 b在诱导下真正做出反应。\n4 a得到果然如此的结论。\nps：分裂的部分就是被否认或压抑的部分。","color":"#e2558c","kwOn":true,"namePos":"top","kwPos":"bottom","nameVy":14,"nameH":"c","nameFs":58,"kwVy":84,"kwH":"c","kwFs":50,"nameBg":"#ffffff","nameBgA":62,"kwBg":"#ffffff","kwBgA":62,"symbolImg":"assets/sym/sowilo.png","imagePath":"images/49.jpg","imageHiPath":null},{"id":"card-mu2dmtf0-h42lyh","name":"强迫性重复","keyword":"","symbol":"✦","faceText":"","meaning":"面对创伤时的一种意识倾向，即 无意识的寻找并进入与旧的模式相似的模式，也或是无意识的将现有模式发展向旧的模式。","color":"#e2558c","kwOn":true,"namePos":"top","kwPos":"bottom","nameVy":14,"nameH":"c","nameFs":58,"kwVy":84,"kwH":"c","kwFs":50,"nameBg":"#ffffff","nameBgA":62,"kwBg":"#ffffff","kwBgA":62,"symbolImg":"assets/sym/sowilo.png","imagePath":"images/50.jpg","imageHiPath":null},{"id":"card-mu2dncm5-n02t6c","name":"反移情","keyword":"","symbol":"✦","faceText":"","meaning":"在咨询师与来访者的关系中，来访者可能会产生移情，并诱使咨询师配合他复现曾经的模式，咨询师通过自身被诱使出的感觉，反向推导出整条逻辑的动作叫做反移情。","color":"#e2558c","kwOn":true,"namePos":"top","kwPos":"bottom","nameVy":14,"nameH":"c","nameFs":58,"kwVy":84,"kwH":"c","kwFs":50,"nameBg":"#ffffff","nameBgA":62,"kwBg":"#ffffff","kwBgA":62,"symbolImg":"assets/sym/sowilo.png","imagePath":"images/51.jpg","imageHiPath":null},{"id":"card-mu2dqxdj-x0rra5","name":"情感隔离","keyword":"防御机制","symbol":"✦","faceText":"","meaning":"","color":"#f59f3e","kwOn":true,"namePos":"top","kwPos":"bottom","nameVy":14,"nameH":"c","nameFs":58,"kwVy":84,"kwH":"c","kwFs":50,"nameBg":"#ffffff","nameBgA":62,"kwBg":"#ffffff","kwBgA":62,"symbolImg":"assets/sym/sowilo.png","imagePath":"images/52.jpg","imageHiPath":null},{"id":"card-mu2e47zn-6oipcf","name":"外倾者","keyword":"艾森克","symbol":"✦","faceText":"","meaning":"天生基线唤醒度极低，大脑像“嗜睡”状态。为了把唤醒度提到舒适区，他们必须不断寻求外部强烈刺激（重低音、社交、冒险）。如果环境太安静，他们会觉得无聊到“大脑关机”。","color":"#2fb89a","kwOn":true,"namePos":"top","kwPos":"bottom","nameVy":14,"nameH":"c","nameFs":58,"kwVy":84,"kwH":"c","kwFs":100,"nameBg":"#ffffff","nameBgA":62,"kwBg":"#ffffff","kwBgA":62,"symbolImg":"assets/sym/sowilo.png","imagePath":"images/53.jpg","imageHiPath":null},{"id":"card-mu2e9xet-wf3pdl","name":"内倾者","keyword":"艾森克","symbol":"✦","faceText":"","meaning":"天生基线唤醒度极高，大脑像“高度戒备”雷达。日常社交或快节奏音乐已经让他们神经过载，所以他们本能回避强刺激，偏爱阅读、独处或轻音乐来“降噪”。","color":"#e5484d","kwOn":true,"namePos":"top","kwPos":"bottom","nameVy":14,"nameH":"c","nameFs":58,"kwVy":84,"kwH":"c","kwFs":100,"nameBg":"#ffffff","nameBgA":62,"kwBg":"#ffffff","kwBgA":62,"symbolImg":"assets/sym/sowilo.png","imagePath":"images/54.jpg","imageHiPath":null},{"id":"card-mu2eb2zv-78lppq","name":"高神经质","keyword":"艾森克","symbol":"✦","faceText":"","meaning":"杏仁核（边缘系统的核心组成部分）极度敏感，微小的惊吓或批评就能引发强烈的焦虑、愤怒。他们情绪波动像“过山车”，且一旦被刺激，唤醒度回落得很慢（容易持续耿耿于怀）。","color":"#3e9ee8","kwOn":true,"namePos":"top","kwPos":"bottom","nameVy":14,"nameH":"c","nameFs":58,"kwVy":84,"kwH":"c","kwFs":100,"nameBg":"#ffffff","nameBgA":62,"kwBg":"#ffffff","kwBgA":62,"symbolImg":"assets/sym/sowilo.png","imagePath":"images/55.jpg","imageHiPath":null},{"id":"card-mu2ec5gv-zfqfz7","name":"低神经质","keyword":"艾森克","symbol":"✦","faceText":"","meaning":"杏仁核阈值高，遇事冷静，应激后心率、血压能快速恢复平稳。他们不太容易被外界情绪“带跑”，情绪稳定。","color":"#a465c8","kwOn":true,"namePos":"top","kwPos":"bottom","nameVy":14,"nameH":"c","nameFs":58,"kwVy":84,"kwH":"c","kwFs":100,"nameBg":"#ffffff","nameBgA":62,"kwBg":"#ffffff","kwBgA":62,"symbolImg":"assets/sym/sowilo.png","imagePath":"images/56.jpg","imageHiPath":null},{"id":"card-mu2fi4rj-czt0v2","name":"被欲望位置","keyword":"被观看的花瓶","symbol":"✦","faceText":"","meaning":"","color":"#5b7cfa","kwOn":true,"namePos":"top","kwPos":"bottom","nameVy":14,"nameH":"c","nameFs":58,"kwVy":84,"kwH":"c","kwFs":50,"nameBg":"#ffffff","nameBgA":62,"kwBg":"#ffffff","kwBgA":62,"symbolImg":"assets/sym/sowilo.png","imagePath":"images/57.jpg","imageHiPath":null},{"id":"card-mu2ficmm-jzy8t9","name":"欲望主体位","keyword":"观看花瓶者","symbol":"✦","faceText":"","meaning":"","color":"#8a5cf6","kwOn":true,"namePos":"top","kwPos":"bottom","nameVy":14,"nameH":"c","nameFs":58,"kwVy":84,"kwH":"c","kwFs":100,"nameBg":"#ffffff","nameBgA":62,"kwBg":"#ffffff","kwBgA":62,"symbolImg":"assets/sym/sowilo.png","imagePath":"images/58.jpg","imageHiPath":null}]}}